### **.gitignore**

```gitignore
# Node.js
node_modules/
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*

# Vite
dist/
.vite/
.env.development
.env.local
.env.*.local

# TypeScript
*.tsbuildinfo

# Mac / Windows
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Logs
logs
*.log

# IDE
.idea/
.vscode/
*.suo
*.ntvs*
*.njsproj
*.sln

# Build output
/build
